  "uncertain": [
   "Convention (same as e_team_names_02): pilot/ship-named X隊 = 'X Team' with glossary short names; 分隊/小隊 = 'Squad'/'Squadron' (キリコ分隊 = Chirico Squad, ピクシー小隊 = Pixie Squadron like Skull Squadron); epithets without article.",
   "フォウ隊 = 'Four Team': correct per glossary (Four Murasame) but can read as a number.",
   "幸せ隊 / 不死身隊 = 'Team Happy' / 'Team Immortal' (Colasour's epithets; story: 'Happy/Immortal $$コーラサワー$$'); 'Happy Team' was the literal alternative.",
   "竹尾Ｇカンパニー = 'Takeo G Company' (hybrid of Takeo GC / Takeo General Company; alternative 'Takeo General Co.').",
   "１２の鍵 = 'Twelve Keys' (sits with Sphere Reactor/Reactor; story calls the Spheres keys). 超Ａ級超能力者 = 'Super A-Class Esper' (glossary 超能力者 = Esper, proposed).",
   "噂の快男児 = 'Famed Dashing Fellow' (story: 'The much-talked-about dashing fellow'); ザ・ストーム = 'The Storm' (Banjo); 小学生組 = 'Grade-School Team' (組 = Team as squad_names 少年組 = Boys Team).",
   "Wing epithets: 陽気な死神 = 'Cheerful God of Death' (dialogue 853:t_32:13), 名無しのピエロ = 'Nameless Clown' (Jigoku), 砂漠の王子 = 'Desert Prince', メテオ = 'Meteor' (Operation Meteor), ウインド / ファイヤー = 'Wind' / 'Fire' (Preventer code names of Zechs / Noin; inferred from position).",
   "ザフトレッド = 'ZAFT Red' (dialogue dlg_2072_06); 超兵 = 'Super Soldiers' (dialogue); 白き流星 = 'White Meteor' (Jigoku + voice g065); オーバーフラッグス = 'Over Flags'; ブシドー = 'Bushido'; ロメオ００８ = 'Romeo 008' (Riddhe's callsign).",
   "デ・ダナン隊 = 'De Danaan Team' (ship short name; glossary has only Tuatha de Danaan and bare ダナン = Danaan)."
